# Android components

The Compose building block for each component in [../../components.md](../../components.md), where Android differs. Mobile
behaviour: [../components.md](../components.md). Conventions: [android.md](android.md).

| Component | Compose |
|---|---|
| Button | `Button` / `OutlinedButton` / `TextButton` colours from the theme; height at least 48dp. |
| Input | `OutlinedTextField` with `label` and `supportingText`; `keyboardOptions` set. |
| Select | `ExposedDropdownMenuBox`; long lists use a separate screen or sheet. |
| Checkbox, radio, switch | `Checkbox`, `RadioButton`, `Switch` inside a labelled, clickable row. |
| Card | `Card` with the theme's shape and container colour. |
| Badge, chip | `AssistChip` / `FilterChip` or a small icon-plus-word row. |
| Dialog | `AlertDialog`. |
| Sheet | `ModalBottomSheet`. |
| Menu | `DropdownMenu`. |
| Tabs | `NavigationBar` (top-level) or `TabRow`. |
| Toast | `Snackbar` through a `SnackbarHost`, with an action for undo. |
| Empty / error state | A column with icon, message and action, styled with the theme. |
| Skeleton | A shimmer-free placeholder `Box` with the `sunk` colour. |

Add the project's own composables here, with the file they live in; update [../../inventory.md](../../inventory.md).
